              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "vmedici"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It's a good recipe, but if you are vegetarian be aware that Worcesteshire has anchovies in it. Tamarind is what gives Worcesteshire its \"oomph,\" so use a tiny bit of tamarind and vinegar to get a hint of that flavor.",
            "datePublished": "2011-11-20T16:04:22.923Z"
