            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Volleyballmom"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I didn't have parsnip so was omitted. I doubled the recipe and had plenty leftovers. Prior to serving I added grated Parmesan. We always had it with parm as kids. I love it that way. Good recipe, I will make this again for sure! Thanks Judith!",
            "datePublished": "2013-11-22T03:57:12.897Z"
